  updated="Effective Date: August 6, 2026"
  intro="This Terms of Use Agreement (the “Agreement”) is made between you and Polychlorinated Ventures LLC DBA Crucible (“Company,” “we,” “us,” or “our”). This Agreement governs your access to and use of the website (trycrucible.com, app.trycrucible.com), mobile applications, and all associated AI-assisted video editing, interviewing, and content generation services (collectively, the “Services”)."
